+                  "## Per-second views (±60 s)", "### ±60 s around restart 2026-10-30T10:05:00Z",
+                  "### ±60 s around stall 2026-10-30T10:02:00Z", "### ±60 s around the time 2026-10-30T10:02:00Z"):
+            self.assertIn(h, text)
